:{"date":"2026-10-05T18:49:31Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"ZKUI-520: align the IAM tables'' header row with their rows\n\nThe action column is sized by its content while its header is empty, so the header stopped at\nthe column''s floor and the rows grew past it. The difference came out of the body''s flexible\ncolumns alone, so their left edges drifted further with every column. The reserved width is\nnow a custom property switched by the same container query that collapses the buttons, and\nheader and rows read one number in either state.\n\nDelete on the access keys table gets a collapse threshold too, so it no longer overlaps the\ncollapsed-columns chip.","tree":{"sha":"de548560e36593f7f0b7d2a2d3d12419e4435987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/de548560e36593f7f0b7d2a2d3d12419e4435987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/7186d519f26d575cad6d75a83cef994e5f4fee72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/7186d519f26d575cad6d75a83cef994e5f4fee72","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDcxODZkNTE5ZjI2ZDU3NWNhZDZkNzVhODNjZWY5OTRlNWY0ZmVlNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee","sha":"d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee"}],"sha":"7186d519f26d575cad6d75a83cef994e5f4fee72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/7186d519f26d575cad6d75a83cef994e5f4fee72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:44:25Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:44:25Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"ZKUI-520: make the Storage Location column drop and shrink without the library bump\n\nAn override replaces the default column outright on the pinned version, so this column\ninherited neither its flex nor its drop threshold and pinned the table''s minimum width.\nRestating both here removes the ordering dependency on DBR-78; only the column''s sorting\nstill waits for it.","tree":{"sha":"db0c6e04b77fa06a6e172c3f1ee2edbdbde2538a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/db0c6e04b77fa06a6e172c3f1ee2edbdbde2538a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGQzMDMzOWFkYTZiNDQ1MDQ2ZWVkNTQzNjY0YTQwNzM5Y2YwNDY2ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062","sha":"caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062"}],"sha":"d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d30339ada6b445046eed543664a40739cf0466ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:04:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:04:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(ZKUI-520): give the ISV connector button its own collapse threshold\n\nSharing the bucket list''s own threshold put the label on the wrong side of the\nsqueeze: the two buttons together measure 343px, so by the time 480 fires the\nsearch field beside them is already pinned to its floor. 660 is where the\ntoolbar''s left block still holds the counter, a usable search field and refresh.\n\nAlso trims the thresholds'' comments to the numbers that justify them.","tree":{"sha":"4b8ad66ad898251bc36d1f1af4f09157b0681f1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/4b8ad66ad898251bc36d1f1af4f09157b0681f1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGNhZjgzNjFkMWNkOTRlYTgyZmZiY2ZiYmY3MWRiNDdkMWU3MDkwNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/d75263fbc4395f06d3cc29631fc6ab1a6c832dac","sha":"d75263fbc4395f06d3cc29631fc6ab1a6c832dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d75263fbc4395f06d3cc29631fc6ab1a6c832dac"}],"sha":"caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/caf8361d1cd94ea82ffbcfbbf71db47d1e709062"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d75263fbc4395f06d3cc29631fc6ab1a6c832dac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:32Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(ZKUI-520): let the bucket list columns give way\n\nEvery column this app injects into the bucket list carried a fixed pixel width\nand no drop threshold, so 430px of the table was reserved unconditionally -- 610\nwith the XDM feature on. Bucket Name and Created on absorbed the whole squeeze:\nat a 453px container the name was 0px wide and the header row overflowed by 38px.\n\nThe Storage Location entry also overrode a column the library already defines.\nAn override replaces that column outright, so the fixed width took away its flex,\nits sorting and its drop threshold as well. It now overrides only the renderer --\nours appends the service name to the location -- and inherits the rest.\n\nData Used and Metadata updates become flexible and get a threshold of their own,\nderived from the measured content demand of the columns beside them.\n\nTwo smaller fixes on the same surface:\n\nStart ISV Connector had no icon and no collapse threshold, so it stayed 178px\nwide beside a Create Bucket button that collapses to 33px -- 39% of the pane at\nthat width. It now collapses with it.\n\nThe bucket detail rows this app injects were built from a local copy of the\nkey/value primitives that has no container query, so they never stacked however\nnarrow the panel got. They move to the library''s own field component, which does.\nThat copy had no other consumer and is deleted.","tree":{"sha":"d3cd8dee5ff55b29991ed41537ce5307601ad564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/d3cd8dee5ff55b29991ed41537ce5307601ad564"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/d75263fbc4395f06d3cc29631fc6ab1a6c832dac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon