ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/8ddf6bbeb31706a7ff8be9450a1d52d04865418a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:09:23Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:11Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(isv): share one copyable-value row across the summaries (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe same 20rem row was declared three times -- the default summary, the Veeam\nrepository summary and the Rubrik summary -- and only the first was fixed. The\nother two carry an unbounded S3 endpoint, repository name and bucket name in a\nbox that cannot shrink.\n\nExtract the row once so a fourth copy is harder to write, and give the two\nremaining summaries the same treatment as the first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5dc6f1a14c6dd2feaad53be4cdae149e8b9db99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/e5dc6f1a14c6dd2feaad53be4cdae149e8b9db99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/8ddf6bbeb31706a7ff8be9450a1d52d04865418a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",