rl":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/06d6af50eb76587d0b1e053be6e61af31e967f03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:59:12Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(isv): give the Apply Actions table columns workable widths (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe rows are flex rows with 150px / 50% / 12.5% columns, which left 37.5% of each row\nunclaimed on a wide form and, because the cells are content-box and add 32px of\npadding apiece, pushed the row past its edge on a narrow one. The Status column in\nparticular was given 12.5% for an icon, \"Failed\" and a Retry button.\n\nStep is the only column whose content is bounded -- a step number -- so it is the only\none pinned, at 3.5rem. Status may shrink below a 9rem basis, wrapping the Retry button\nunder the label, and the action sentence takes the rest and ellipsises through\nConstrainedText so what no longer fits is readable on hover instead of silently cut.\nNothing carries a minimum, because any floor here is paid for in overflow: an 8rem\nfloor on the action column put 45px back at a 768px content box.\n\nSized against the 18.56px root the shell actually serves, not the 14.72px of a\ndefault page. Measured 768 to 1920: no overflow at any width, including a row in its\nerror state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b429d4fa32c48250684d317f34ff302173894e2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/b429d4fa32c48250684d317f34ff302173894e2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/06d6af50eb76587d0b1e053be6e61af31e967f03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/06d6af50eb76587d0b1e053be6e61af31e967f03","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDA2ZDZhZjUwZWI3NjU4N2QwYjFlMDUzYmU2ZTYxYWYzMWU5NjdmMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381","sha":"ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381"}],"sha":"06d6af50eb76587d0b1e053be6e61af31e967f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/06d6af50eb76587d0b1e053be6e61af31e967f03"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:59:12Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(isv): keep the summary values inside their fields (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe service endpoint, access key and bucket name sit in a 20rem box beside a\ncopy button. The box could not shrink and the values are unbreakable strings,\nso on a narrow content column each row spilled out of its field.\n\nCap the box instead of fixing it, let it stretch to the field cell, and render\nthe values through ConstrainedText so the squeeze ends in an ellipsis with a\ntooltip rather than an overflow. The secret key already did this through\nHideCredential.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7ca49d01b25b1493191c7c4a33e76b0d0221227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/c7ca49d01b25b1493191c7c4a33e76b0d0221227"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGVkMjY2ODg5Mzk4MmI5MTc3N2RmZjNhNmE1NDc0ZmNhM2RiMjEzODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45","sha":"cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45"}],"sha":"ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/ed2668893982b91777dff3a6a5474fca3db21381"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:41:30Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(isv): give the bucket boxes room below the bucket count (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nOnce more than one bucket is requested each one gets its own tinted box, and the\nbox was shifted 16px upwards so it sat 10px below the Number of buckets field --\nclose enough to read as part of it rather than as the start of a new section.\nThe shift was cosmetic only: it moved the box without moving the space it\noccupies, leaving the same 16px as a hole underneath.\n\nDrop it, and the relative positioning that existed solely to carry it. The gap\nis now 26px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cd584b1162847ebc32e61278dafd71d978a9809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/9cd584b1162847ebc32e61278dafd71d978a9809"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGNjNTI5MGJlYjc0MmYyNmQ2N2Q2ODRmYjg1ODI5ZjY0ODY3NzdiNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9","sha":"81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9"}],"sha":"cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/cc5290beb742f26d67d684fb85829f6486777b45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:32:49Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(isv): let the capacity and retention fields shrink with their column (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nEach of these fields is a number Input beside a unit -- a Select for the two\ncapacities, a \"day(s)\" label for the retention period -- wrapped in a Stack\nbetween the FormGroup''s content and the controls. Their help sits below, which\nleft-aligns the field cell, so the wrapper shrank to its content and pinned the\ncontrols at their intrinsic width instead of following the column. At a 768px\ncontent box the Veeam repository capacity row ran 6px past its cell.\n\nOpt the wrappers back into stretching, as the ISV account and IAM user name\nfields already do.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50529eef96c2018d448e3205cb4e85352a2bcdae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/50529eef96c2018d448e3205cb4e85352a2bcdae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDgxZjIzM2Y1N2JiMWY3NmY0ODNiZmQwMDU5MmM4MWI0YWE1ZTIzZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/8aebc693216ccbd4379a0375419b69bda047aa53","sha":"8aebc693216ccbd4379a0375419b69bda047aa53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/8aebc693216ccbd4379a0375419b69bda047aa53"}],"sha":"81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/81f233f57bb1f76f483bfd00592c81b4aa5e23d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/8aebc693216ccbd4379a0375419b69bda047aa53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:50:20Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(crr): let the Base domain input shrink with its field (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nCapping the input at 22rem also removed the max-width: 100% it had, and a flex\nitem''s automatic minimum size is clamped by its max-width -- so that 100% was\nwhat let the input shrink past the 151px its size attribute asks for. With the\ncap in its place the input stopped shrinking at 151px while the field cell kept\ngoing, and spilled out by 19px at a 768px content box and 40px at 560.\n\nGive it a floor of its own. The cap stays; the input now tracks the cell at\nevery width, as the Username and Password fields beside it already did.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff8d7a8d1239b663dda97faf2a19f64f651c7510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/ff8d7a8d1239b663dda97faf2a19f64f651c7510"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/8aebc693216ccbd4379a0375419b69bda047aa53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht