//api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/521f2192e7e166b208e8f0f4bdcccdb51e5ca6c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:37:08Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(crr): keep the destination account shortcut inside its field (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe button that fills the destination account name from the source one could\nnot shrink below its own label, so at a 768px content box it ran 98px past its\n169px field column and 71px past the form itself. It only looked right again\nbelow the stacking threshold, where the field regains its full width.\n\nShorten the label to \"Use Source site name\" and remove the copy icon. The icon\nread as \"copy this field''s value\" rather than \"fill this field from the source\",\nand spelling out \"account name\" neither fits the column nor adds anything beside\na field already labelled Account name. The button is now 147px and clears its\ncolumn down to a 520px content box.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e16c9b0ff780c11a4e63fc68a754f89862a2f29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/1e16c9b0ff780c11a4e63fc68a754f89862a2f29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/521f2192e7e166b208e8f0f4bdcccdb51e5ca6c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/521f2192e7e166b208e8f0f4bdcccdb51e5ca6c3","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDUyMWYyMTkyZTdlMTY2YjIwOGU4ZjBmNGJkY2NjZGI1MWU1Y2E2YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/80262e6ae680c7e12f89d89edbe7dfecb03b17b2","sha":"80262e6ae680c7e12f89d89edbe7dfecb03b17b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/80262e6ae680c7e12f89d89edbe7dfecb03b17b2"}],"sha":"521f2192e7e166b208e8f0f4bdcccdb51e5ca6c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/521f2192e7e166b208e8f0f4bdcccdb51e5ca6c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/80262e6ae680c7e12f89d89edbe7dfecb03b17b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:45:16Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(accounts): let the attachment confirmation fit its modal (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe confirmation''s content box was pinned at 50rem. A wide modal''s body takes its\nwidth from its content and scrolls horizontally rather than shrink, so the whole\nconfirmation sat behind a scrollbar on any window under about 930px. It now caps at\nwhat the modal can offer -- its own 90vw less the body''s padding.\n\nThe attach table''s status column had a share but no floor, so it shrank past its own\nheader (112px against 55px for the longest value it labels) and the title disappeared\nwhile the values still read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3e09ef7b2d2cea8479129f734e57af31211b341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/b3e09ef7b2d2cea8479129f734e57af31211b341"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits