}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/b6b81287c98fea1d585a1716a3f6e164c3669a51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:05:12Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(accounts): keep the access key inside its own column (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nAn access key is twenty characters with no break opportunity, so the cell held its\nfull length whatever the column was given and painted over the Created On date beside\nit below a ~590px panel. The value now clamps to the column and carries its full text\nin a tooltip once it does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46237acb1d69c38404e0dec280346336a59146cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/46237acb1d69c38404e0dec280346336a59146cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/b6b81287c98fea1d585a1716a3f6