pi.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/28a71e107aa960884c225102f318c9fbf2c3f68e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:48:11Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(accounts): let the policy editor and the attach table fit (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe policy document editor was fixed at 33rem, so the create, edit and view\npolicy pages all ran past their own right edge once the form column was\nnarrower than that. It now fills the column, and its copy button moves under it\nrather than beside it once the two together leave too little to read a line of\nJSON in. The wrapper holding it opts back into stretching, since a form group\nwhose help sits below left-aligns its field cell.\n\nThe attach-entities table asked for 20rem of name and 10rem of action before\nanything else, about 485px of hard minimum in a panel narrower than that, which\nis what put a horizontal scrollbar under it. The name column takes the slack\ninstead, and the row''s Remove button collapses to its icon like every other\nrow action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfc1a4685cc0135fac13874a326826d43660a8e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/dfc1a4685cc0135fac13874a326826d43660a8e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/28a71e107aa960884c225102f318c9fbf2c3f68e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/28a71e107aa960884c225102f318c9fbf2c3f68e","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDI4YTcxZTEwN2FhOTYwODg0YzIyNTEwMmYzMThjOWZiZjJjM2Y2OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6","sha":"816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6"}],"sha":"28a71e107aa960884c225102f318c9fbf2c3f68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/28a71e107aa960884c225102f318c9fbf2c3f68e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:31:17Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(accounts): make the account detail panels hold 768 (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nDelete Account and Create Access key collapse to their icons under a 768px\npanel, on a threshold of their own: a panel action sits beside a title rather\nthan in a toolbar row, so it has to give way sooner than a toolbar action does.\n\nAccount ID and Name were floored at 220px each, which stopped the whole details\npanel shrinking while the page still had room. The floor is now what keeps a\nvalue legible, and the two identifiers clamp to two lines instead of wrapping\ndown the panel.\n\nIn the root access keys table the action column held the largest share of the\nrow, which parked the delete button at the far edge with the date stranded in\nthe middle. The key column takes the slack now, and the date and the action\neach have a floor.\n\nAlso restores the Locations tab: it was given a container that stretches to a\nflex parent it does not have, so the table had no height and drew no rows while\nstill counting them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b10ff83930a8c0c8f1b89e359043fa45415b0ae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/b10ff83930a8c0c8f1b89e359043fa45415b0ae4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDgxNmM1ZWE1MWI0Y2RkMGM1NzhjZTFhOTNmMmNjNjI2Y2Q3OWI5ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f","sha":"1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f"}],"sha":"816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/816c5ea51b4cdd0c578ce1a93f2cc626cd79b9d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:11:14Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(isv): keep the connector modal wider than its own body (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe modal box was pinned to a flat 60vw while the body inside it keeps a 480px\nfloor of its own. Under roughly an 800px window the box is the narrower of the\ntwo, so the body spilled out of it — and went on spilling all the way down,\nwhich is why the overflow survived every drop in the number of cards per row.\n\nMeasured across 400-1268px: the body exceeded the box by 5px at 792px, 156px at\n520px and 136px at 452px. With the floor it is 0 at every width.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce613264f819e6c55ffcf68cc6d3bc68a02f0bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/ce613264f819e6c55ffcf68cc6d3bc68a02f0bd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDFkMDk5ZTY3ZDIwNmRiZDQ2YzVjNzgwZDkzMDYxZTYwNWU3NjA4NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6","sha":"1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6"}],"sha":"1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/1d099e67d206dbd46c5c780d93061e605e76084f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:30:20Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(isv): let the connector cards shrink to their grid track (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nEach logo carries its own px width, the widest 183px, so a card stopped at whatever\nits logo needed and spilled out of its grid track -- visible as an overflow at two\ncards per row, before the grid dropped to one.\n\nScaling the logo is not enough on its own: a percentage max-width is ignored while a\nflex or grid item''s automatic minimum size is computed, so the logo keeps holding the\ncard open at its full width. Every box between the track and the logo now says it may\nshrink, and the card''s own 12rem floor goes with them -- the track already carries\nthat floor, and a second one could only sit above it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be02b72b0e4b4c4fd1d23a1641b8954ab5fbad0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/be02b72b0e4b4c4fd1d23a1641b8954ab5fbad0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDE0NjAzMzY0NzNlZWQzNzVhM2FlMjQ1NTUxYzc3ODU4NDE2ODRhYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/f21290e1df69934b52931b51a071510e5120211a","sha":"f21290e1df69934b52931b51a071510e5120211a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/f21290e1df69934b52931b51a071510e5120211a"}],"sha":"1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/1460336473eed375a3ae245551c7785841684ac6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/f21290e1df69934b52931b51a071510e5120211a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:13:32Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(lists): align the action column''s header with its cells (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe action column''s floor was `max-content`, and the table applies one cellStyle\nto the header row and to the body rows. The header of that column is empty, so it\nmeasured near zero while the body cells measured the buttons: the two rows\ndisagreed on the column''s width and every boundary in the row shifted.\n\nA fixed floor measures the same in both rows.\n\nAlso caps the ISV connector grid at three cards per row, by keeping the track\nfloor at no less than a third of the row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e612b19900ac840cdf17bead8f0176499b79964d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/e612b19900ac840cdf17bead8f0176499b79964d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/f21290e1df69934b52931b51a071510e5120211a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{