JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/33dc2a1111356b1a02807576c49cb80b4358ce4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:10:16Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(accounts): keep Data Used and give the row a right gutter (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nData Used no longer drops: now that Account Name takes the row''s slack, the\ncolumn fits well below the 500px container it was dropping at, and it is the\none figure a storage manager comes to the list for.\n\nThe table gives its cells no right gutter, so the last column''s value sat on\nthe panel border. Every right-aligned column now carries one, since which\ncolumn is last depends on the user''s role and on whether Created On dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0972e5567cf6ac4a23723e84443c521315c0190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/c0972e5567cf6ac4a23723e84443c521315c0190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/33dc2a1111356b1a02807576c49cb80b4358ce4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"a