ality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/71eedc11336340c4008a1b43ff347ad0e8eae7a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:05:02Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(accounts): let the account name column fill the row (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe table lays its columns out in blocks, so a column that states no `flex` keeps the\n150px default width. No column here stated one, so the three together stopped well\nshort of the row''s right edge and left the rest of it empty — an oddity on a wide\nscreen and a waste as the screen narrows. The name is the column with something to\nsay, so it takes the slack.\n\nIts floor comes down from 20rem to what it needs to stay readable: the name is a\n`ConstrainedText` clamped to two lines, so past the floor it ellipsises rather than\noverflows, and until now the floor rather than the content was setting the width.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8763b967393c2114c8d93a47850a9c0bd1759dc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/8763b967393c2114c8d93a47850a9c0bd1759dc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/71eedc11336340c4008a1b43ff347ad0e8eae7a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/71eedc11336340c4008a1b43ff347ad0e8eae7a9","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDcxZWVkYzExMzM2MzQwYzQwMDhhMWI0M2ZmMzQ3YWQwZThlYWU3YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270","sha":"e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270"}],"sha":"71eedc11336340c4008a1b43ff347ad0e8eae7a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/71eedc11336340c4008a1b43ff347ad0e8eae7a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:55:17Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(lists): keep the row actions inside the table''s right padding (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe action column takes a share of the free width on a zero basis, which at a narrow\ncontainer resolves to less than its buttons need. The buttons then spill past the\ncell and sit on the panel edge, with the column''s right padding behind them. A\n`max-content` floor is a floor rather than a measured width, so it keeps holding if a\nbutton is added or its size changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d20dcef848805f18fbf6ba8d653b1f50fccafbde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/d20dcef848805f18fbf6ba8d653b1f50fccafbde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGU5YzYyMDc0ZTdjZDc4MTUxMTZiZjkxN2JhMDhmNGE1NjFhZjgyNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff","sha":"408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff"}],"sha":"e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/e9c62074e7cd7815116bf917ba08f4a561af8270"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:55:11Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(forms): let a wrapped control shrink with its field column (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nA FormGroup whose help or error sits below left-aligns its field cell, so a control\nsized only by its own attributes keeps that size in the fluid field column. Any\nwrapper placed between `content` and the control inherits that alignment, shrinks to\nits content, and pins a full-width Input inside it to its intrinsic width — so the\nfield stopped shrinking while the column around it did.\n\nAffects the ISV account and IAM user name fields, every location form''s list input\n(the RING bootstrap list, the Tape DMF repository ids) and the replication wizard''s\ndestination account name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"939b3ec6031c1c2f728c4fe6de26ac268d3ba4b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/939b3ec6031c1c2f728c4fe6de26ac268d3ba4b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDQwOGYxOGY2M2U2ZDM4ZDhjOGFkYWEyNjY2OTk1N2I2MWFjZTdmZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0","sha":"e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0"}],"sha":"408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/408f18f63e6d38d8c8adaa26669957b61ace7fff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:05:33Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:10Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): split the list action collapse thresholds (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe 760px at which a list surface''s actions drop their labels was repeated as a bare\nliteral across 16 call sites in 7 files, with nothing recording what it measures. One\nthreshold for every action also proved too eager on the real pages: a row action sits\nin a column far narrower than the page and has to collapse early, while a toolbar\naction has the whole row and does not.\n\nName both in one module and split them. Row actions keep 760, just under the 768px\ncontent box this work targets; toolbar actions move to 620, where the busiest toolbar\nactually runs out of room (32px row padding + the 139px search floor + two 16px gaps +\na 237px and a 179px action = 619px).\n\nThree corrections come with it. The toolbar row had no gap, so the search box butted\nagainst the first action; it now uses the same 16px its cells do. Truststore''s Import\nCertificate is alone on its row with nothing to make room for, so it keeps its label.\nData Services'' Advanced Metrics had no threshold at all and stayed full width while\nits neighbours collapsed; it takes the toolbar one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac92e5137362606949e9059350e54dd0922895a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/ac92e5137362606949e9059350e54dd0922895a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGU5YjA5NjBjNTYzYmM5ODFhMDAyMTY1ZGE5OWI0ZTkxM2FhNmFhYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd","sha":"0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd"}],"sha":"e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/e9b0960c563bc981a002165da99b4e913aa6aab0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:05:26Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:09Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(tables): let the list toolbars shrink so the search box can (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe search box carries its own percentage max-width, but a percentage max-width is\nignored while a flex item''s automatic minimum size is computed, so the row and the\ncell holding it stayed pinned to their max-content width and the search box never\nnarrowed — pushing the actions out of the toolbar instead.\n\nMeasured on Accounts, container swept 1200px down to 480px: the search box now goes\n329px -> 297 -> 199 -> 169 and floors at 139px, with nothing past the toolbar''s right\nedge and no horizontal scroll at any width.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bd42a120ac42d8191d0a9ad9d109e91d92b8fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/5bd42a120ac42d8191d0a9ad9d109e91d92b8fde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDAyMjg5NzBkZTMxNDU5NjQzMDcxNzAyYzYzMjc5NTliYmZmN2M0ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204","sha":"a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204"}],"sha":"0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/0228970de31459643071702c6327959bbff7c4dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:55:18Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:09Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(forms): give the label columns a cap that follows the root size (ARTESCA-17790)\n\n`FormSection` emits a numeric `forceLabelWidth` as literal px, so the label column\ncould not grow with its own text. The shell''s root font size is viewport-dependent —\n14px at 1268, 18.56px at 1920 — so on a wide screen the labels grew 26% inside an\nunchanged column and wrapped, and on a narrow one the column held room the labels no\nlonger needed.\n\nExpress all 18 caps as rem instead, each the px value it replaces taken at the 14.72px\nroot of a 1440px viewport. Two `calc()` sites appended `px` to the shared constant;\nthey already mixed `20.5rem + 2rem + 280px` and are now coherent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4a70f068662f4d4c91ed4b8b929cce0dc00f438","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/f4a70f068662f4d4c91ed4b8b929cce0dc00f438"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGEyNzFhZDM1NWI4NjNiNThiMzk1ZmJhMDYwMjlhMmE1MDlmZjQyMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30","sha":"bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30"}],"sha":"a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a271ad355b863b58b395fba06029a2a509ff4204"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:51:55Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:09Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(forms): let the form fields receive the layout their form declares (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nEvery `responsive` Form in the app was inert: the fields kept their fixed width at\nany container size, so a form could not shrink and overflowed a narrow content box.\n\n`Form` was imported from the bare `@scality/core-ui`, which the rspack config shares\nwith the host for every dependency, while `Input` and `Select` come from `dist/next`\nand so always from this app''s own bundle. Form passes `responsive`, `error` and\n`disabled` to its fields through a React context created once per copy, so across two\ncopies the fields received none of it. Re-export the family from one module that uses\na deep, unshared entry; both deep entries reach Form.component by relative path, which\nputs a whole form on a single copy.\n\nTwo suites stub `FormGroup` so the component under test needs no enclosing\n`FormSection`, and they mocked the bare specifier the components no longer use, so the\nreal `FormGroup` rendered and threw across 18 tests. Each stub moves onto the module\nits component now imports, unchanged otherwise.\n\nMeasured on Create Account, container swept 1200px down to 400px: the section now\nflips to one column at 480px and the field shrinks to 336px at 400px, with no\noverflow at any width. Before, the field stayed 355.93px throughout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72658850f95c90ff1653ee0f98b7849532a5db2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/72658850f95c90ff1653ee0f98b7849532a5db2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGJiMmVkMWY1OTI3YzFkYzQ5ODdlZjM2MzhmMGYzMjE1YmE2MWJlMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6","sha":"d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6"}],"sha":"bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/bb2ed1f5927c1dc4987ef3638f0f3215ba61be30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"bugfix(accounts): give the Created On column a font-independent width floor\n\nThe column''s `minWidth` was `20ch`, sized to the 19 characters of\n`date-time-second`. The table applies one `cellStyle` to both the header and the\nbody cells, and the header row is bold while the body rows are not — `ch` is the\nadvance of the element''s own `0` glyph, so the identical value resolved about\n12px wider in the header. The header label sat right of its values, and every\ncolumn after it started at a different offset in the header than in the body.\n\n`10rem` is font-independent, so both rows agree on the column''s width. It is\nalso the unit every other date column in the repo already uses.\n\nPre-existing, and unrelated to the responsive adoption in the other commits.","tree":{"sha":"a5b104244df0ab69c57dc96b69fe90a64557613c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/a5b104244df0ab69c57dc96b69fe90a64557613c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGQyYWM2NGYwZWJjNjgyNmVlZjA5OWU4ZGEwMjJjNzZjYmIwM2E3ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804","sha":"0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804"}],"sha":"d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/d2ac64f0ebc6826eef099e8da022c76cbb03a7d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): let the row''s Copy ARN button collapse with its siblings (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe outline `CopyButton` reserves width for its success label (\"Copy ARN\" ->\n\"Copied ARN!\"), and that floor used to be an inline style an `iconOnly`\ncontainer query could not outrank — so the one button in the row that could not\ncollapse held the whole action cell wider than its column and the row bled out\nof the panel. The floor is now a stylesheet rule scoped to the same breakpoint\nas the label, so `iconOnly={760}` collapses the button and drops the floor\ntogether.\n\nThe action columns keep their 16rem `minWidth`. That floor is what holds the\nempty action header to the same width as its cells, and a `cellStyle` floor\ncannot itself respond to a container query — so a column cannot have one width\nfor its labelled state and another for its collapsed one. Shrinking the cell''s\ncontent below the floor is the fix available here.","tree":{"sha":"2460797ab78abf1fdeff2760d8c73ef3b4b87a55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/2460797ab78abf1fdeff2760d8c73ef3b4b87a55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDBmZGYzYmMyYmNlOTFmMzZiYzllOGM2N2RhYjNjNTU5OTZiY2Q4MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001","sha":"3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001"}],"sha":"0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/0fdf3bc2bce91f36bc9e8c67dab3c55996bcd804"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): make every page form responsive (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nThe `kind: ''page''` forms were the largest surface left pinned: the page layout\nhard-coded a 45rem width, so `responsive` on a page form was inert and the form\noverflowed a narrow content box rather than narrowing. That width is now a cap,\nso the prop does what it says — fields go fluid and the sections stack on the\nreadability floor.\n\n15 forms across 14 files. The two policy forms share `CommonPolicyLayout`, and\nLocationEditor''s `styled(Form)` wrapper forwards the prop.\n\nThe three forms that overrode the layout with `width: 50rem` now cap at 50rem\nand take `width: 100%` instead, so the override no longer re-pins them.\n\nTwo fixed widths inside these forms are deliberately left alone. ImportCertificate''s\n`min-content` wrapper and its `68ch` TextArea have no `Input` or `Select` beside\nthem, so there is no fluid field for the wrapper to starve; and the policy\n`Editor`''s 33rem sits in a `direction=\"vertical\"` FormGroup, so the label is\nabove it rather than beside it and the pair clears a 768px box.","tree":{"sha":"ff4e7eff529c2a4e4f7a22b55a57f9f7d8edeaf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/ff4e7eff529c2a4e4f7a22b55a57f9f7d8edeaf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDNhMGJlY2JiNjNhNjdkMzk0NjIyYzQ5NjIwMDk5MDRlZTcyOGUwMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039","sha":"a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039"}],"sha":"3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/3a0becbb63a67d394622c4962009904ee728e001"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): make the account/role picker form responsive (ARTESCA-17790)\n\n`responsive` gives the form a fluid field track and stacks each row to a single\ncolumn once the label and field can no longer share the width. The fields need\nno prop of their own — `FormGroup` passes it down through `FieldContext`, so the\n`Select`s go fluid on their own.\n\nThis is the one `kind: ''tab''` form in the repo. The page forms and the two\nwizards are a different shape and follow in the next commit.","tree":{"sha":"56a5510ff13a4a917bbaf63ee9cc14751b489955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/56a5510ff13a4a917bbaf63ee9cc14751b489955"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGE2NWIyOTg2YmUyNzNkODlmMTg0NDM1Zjc3ODQ4ODQ0NjkxZDMwMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056","sha":"15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056"}],"sha":"a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a65b2986be273d89f184435f77848844691d3039"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): collapse list actions to icons below 760px (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nA deliberate change of appearance: below a 760px container the toolbar and\nrow-action buttons keep their icon and drop their label. 760 is the page\ncontainer''s width once the shell''s side drawer opens on a 1268px browser —\nabove it, including the full-width case, nothing changes.\n\n`iconOnly` preserves the accessible name from the string label and supplies a\ntooltip, so the buttons stay reachable and hoverable.\n\nTwo columns were pinned wider than their content could ever need — the users\nactions column at a hard 24rem and the policies one at a 25rem floor — which\nwould have made the collapse invisible. Both now size to their content with a\n16rem floor set by the outline `CopyButton`''s success-label reservation; a later\ncommit collapses that button too.\n\n`StartISVConnectorButton` is left alone: it has no icon, so collapsing it would\nleave an empty button. Giving it one is a design decision, not a repair.\n\nAdds the jsdom `@container` shim. jsdom 20 cannot parse `@container` and\ndiscards the entire stylesheet on the first one it meets; styled-components\nemits a single shared sheet, so `iconOnly` alone produced 527 parse errors\nacross the suite. The shim strips container queries in tests only, where they\nmean nothing without layout.","tree":{"sha":"16eb8c84a8743ad2217df715d36ed238bf99f8eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/16eb8c84a8743ad2217df715d36ed238bf99f8eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDE1ODI0ZTVjMzYyMjU0MjM0ZWMxOGY2ZDNkY2FiNWM2ODI0ZjUwNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80","sha":"c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80"}],"sha":"15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/15824e5c362254234ec18f6d3dcab5c6824f5056"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:42Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): drop the least-telling table columns below their fit width (ARTESCA-17790)\n\nA deliberate change of appearance below a threshold, not a repair: at a 768px\ncontent box these tables show fewer columns on purpose.\n\n`dropAt` hides a column while the table''s own box is narrower than the given\nwidth, and `revealDroppedColumns` adds a trailing +N per row whose popover lists\nthe hidden `Header: value` pairs, so nothing becomes unreachable. Thresholds are\nderived from each table''s authored `minWidth`s — the width below which the\nremaining columns can no longer share the row — and drop the least identifying\ncolumn first. The name/identity column and the row actions never drop.\n\nAlso removes the ResizeObserver mock from the jest setup. jsdom performs no\nlayout, so the mock could only report a 0px box, which core-ui''s container-width\nhook reads as a genuinely narrow container: every `dropAt` column dropped and 22\ntests failed on an entry that has no `target`. With ResizeObserver absent the\nhook leaves the width undefined and renders the wide layout, which is what the\nsuite asserts.","tree":{"sha":"69cb28822b584885a4b9decba51ea40db4b85149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/69cb28822b584885a4b9decba51ea40db4b85149"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGMyMGEyMWNhZjQ2OGVhZDRkYTMwZjg4NGM1MGEzNmYxMTkxNWViODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496","sha":"740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496"}],"sha":"c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/c20a21caf468ead4da30f884c50a36f11915eb80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:27Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:41Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"improvement(responsive): declare a responsive container on every list surface (ARTESCA-17790)\n\ncore-ui''s responsive affordances resolve against `@container responsive`, which\nneeds an ancestor declaring `container-type: inline-size`. Nothing in zenko-ui\ndeclared one, so any `iconOnly` or `@container` rule added later would be\nsilently inert.\n\n`AppContainer` cannot carry it — only `Box`, `Form` and `TwoPanelLayout` can —\nso the declaration goes on each surface''s outermost width-driven wrapper, which\ncovers both the toolbar and the table body.\n\n`AwsPaginatedResourceTable` covers the user and policy lists in one place.\nAlso renames LocationsList''s `id`, which was a copy of EndpointList''s and\ncollided with it in the DOM.","tree":{"sha":"ea451deb98ebf17e07d713bb146d9a68a20edc2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/ea451deb98ebf17e07d713bb146d9a68a20edc2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDc0MGM2MjQ1YjY5YzM2NzExMDZiZWMxMTE0OGM4OGRmZGM4NDE0OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/a1cb4922362f58292407539e5a6862d2ad73e37e","sha":"a1cb4922362f58292407539e5a6862d2ad73e37e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a1cb4922362f58292407539e5a6862d2ad73e37e"}],"sha":"740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/740c6245b69c3671106bec11148c88dfdc841496"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/a1cb4922362f58292407539e5a6862d2ad73e37e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:13:26Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:01:41Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"chore(deps): bump @scality/core-ui to 0.230.0 (ARTESCA-17790)\n\n0.230.0 is what makes the responsive adoption in the following commits possible.\nThe capabilities it adds or unblocks, in the order they get used:\n\n- a `page` Form''s 45rem is now a cap rather than a fixed width, so `responsive`\n  on a page form narrows the form instead of doing nothing\n- `Form responsive` no longer collapses to zero width when the form is a\n  content-sized flex item, which is the shape both wizards have\n- an outline `CopyButton`''s success-label width floor became a stylesheet rule\n  scoped to the same breakpoint as its label, so `iconOnly` can collapse it\n- a `FormGroup` label''s help icon no longer wraps onto its own line\n- `SearchInput` can shrink with its container instead of pinning `max-content`\n- tablev2 gives body cells the same min-width reset as the header, keeps a\n  column''s alignment reaching its values, and stops a row''s `onClick`\n  swallowing clicks on interactive cell content\n\nThe last two need no change here — they are fixed entirely inside core-ui and\narrive with the bump.","tree":{"sha":"796573ff579f05ac4154fe8141653d4b49388384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/796573ff579f05ac4154fe8141653d4b49388384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/a1cb4922362f58292407539e5a6862d2ad73e37e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/a1cb4922362f58292407539e5a6