ode_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/18e19e91e95030d4d4b1bb0970d226636184c9c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T09:24:31Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:46:01Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"test(isv): adjust three suites for styled-components v6 (ZKUI-508)\n\nWelcomeModal''s ISVModalContent mock stopped spreading its remaining props onto a\ndiv: selectedISV/setSelectedISV are not DOM attributes, and v6 no longer filters\nthem out, so the spread logged \"React does not recognize the ... prop\".\n\nISVConfiguration mocked the whole of `react` to stub `useRef`. Under the new\ncore-ui that stub returns a fresh object each render, so an effect keyed on the\nref looped. The stub is gone -- the test never needed it.","tree":{"sha":"af9e346c554a2d1b90448fd0c6796f9541838977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/af9e346c554a2d1b90448fd0c6796f9541838977"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/18e19e91e95030d4d4b1bb0970d226636184c9c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/18e19e91e95030d4d4b1bb0970d226636184c9c2","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDE4ZTE5ZTkxZTk1MDMwZDRkNGIxYmIwOTcwZDIyNjYzNjE4NGM5YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/f453accf27d8b60ce22b9c53e5ec931bf9299573","sha":"f453accf27d8b60ce22b9c53e5ec931bf9299573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/f453accf27d8b60ce22b9c53e5ec931bf9299573"}],"sha":"18e19e91e95030d4d4b1bb0970d226636184c9c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/18e19e91e95030d4d4b1bb0970d226636184c9c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/commits/f453accf27d8b60ce22b9c53e5ec931bf9299573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T09:24:31Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T08:46:01Z","email":"jean-marc.millet@scality.com","name":"Jean-Marc Millet"},"message":"chore(deps): bump @scality/core-ui to 0.227.0 and migrate to styled-components v6 (ZKUI-508)\n\nPin styled-components to an exact 6.5.1 and react-router/react-router-dom to\n7.18.2 -- the versions core-ui 0.227.0 itself resolves. Module Federation shares\nthese by `requiredVersion`, so a caret range lets shell-ui and this remote\nresolve different copies and load two runtimes, which breaks theming silently\nrather than crashing. Drop @types/styled-components (v6 ships its own) and add\nthe `DefaultTheme` augmentation that types `props.theme` against CoreUITheme.\n\nv6 stopped filtering unknown props off DOM elements, so every style-only prop is\nnow transient at its definition and at every call site -- 27 of them across the\nui-elements, ISV, account and truststore trees. The compiler cannot catch these:\none loosely-typed JSX spread disables excess-property checking for its sibling\nprops on the same element, so the jsdom console warnings are the real backstop.\n\nThe same bump carries CUI-12, which makes a non-`wide` modal body 480px with\n32px padding and `box-sizing: border-box` -- a 416px content box that crops\nanything wider. Hardcoded child widths come off so the modal owns its size;\n`ISVWideModal` centralises `wide` via `.attrs()` for the ISV flow, and the two\ntable-bearing modals opt into it explicitly.","tree":{"sha":"8354ffdb8d14091e0853796acfb6fb839b0fd735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/8354ffdb8d14091e0853796acfb6fb839b0fd735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/f453accf27d8b60ce22b9c53e5ec931bf9299573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146718185?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeanMarcMilletScality","id":146718185,"login":"JeanMarcMilletScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCL696Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeanMarcMilletScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/f453accf27d8b60ce22b9c53e5ec931bf9299573","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKGY0NTNhY2NmMjdkOGI2MGNlMjJiOWM1M2U1ZWM5MzFiZjkyOTk1NzM","parents":[