ost application\npasses its URL. zenko-ui passed neither and relied on that default, so bumping\nthe dependency on its own would drop both links from the bucket lifecycle rule\nform.\n\nPass the bundled documentation paths explicitly. Expiration is a chapter with\nits own index; transition is a single page.","tree":{"sha":"40ffde21fd47a492478fd79c80024af046266bfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/trees/40ffde21fd47a492478fd79c80024af046266bfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scality/zenko-ui/git/commits/083a69c085c36a4106ea2738874949d5c12928c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181715492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZiyangLinScality","id":181715492,"login":"ZiyangLinScality","node_id":"U_kgDOCtTCJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZiyangLinScality","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/083a69c085c36a4106ea2738874949d5c12928c5","node_id":"C_kwDODlLwp9oAKDA4M2E2OWMwODVjMzZhNDEwNmVhMjczODg3NDk0OWQ1YzEyOTI4YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scality/zenko-ui/commit/2c022194ff66d64b38519a20d1564fb0