hubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/commits/72757328adba55784ada65d35111ca23bfa539b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:12Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a downloadHelper namespace container (#24)\n\nMove the 2 root Query (downloadHelperInfo/Files) + 2 root Mutation (downloadHelperTrigger/\nDeleteFile) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL\nconvention.\n\n- Query:    downloadHelperInfo -> downloadHelper { info }, ...Files -> { files }\n- Mutation: downloadHelperTrigger -> downloadHelper { trigger }, ...DeleteFile -> { deleteFile }\n\nNew holder types DownloadHelperQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods; the *Extension classes keep a single downloadHelper accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + the jest test\n(DownloadHelper.test.jsx mock shapes) and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"287a244c8e65733f667df5bbf20f224d2e1c356a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/trees/287a244c8e65733f667df5bbf20f224d2e1c356a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/commits/72757328adba55784ada65d35111ca23bfa539b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 287a244c8e65733f667df5bbf20f224d2e1c356a\nparent a033d72b610266ebbd2a2cc1ccf9917c0c1b1ff3\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027012 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027012 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a downloadHelper namespace container (#24)\n\nMove the 2 root Query (downloadHelperInfo/Files) + 2 root Mutation (downloadHelperTrigger/\nDeleteFile) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL\nconvention.\n\n- Query:    downloadHelperInfo -> downloadHelper { info }, ...Files -> { files }\n- Mutation: downloadHelperTrigger -> downloadHelper { trigger }, ...DeleteFile -> { deleteFile }\n\nNew holder types DownloadHelperQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods; the *Extension classes keep a single downloadHelper accessor field.\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + the jest test\n(DownloadHelper.test.jsx mock shapes) and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5MECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALXUQABZsg13o9kWjoa6bYX8JTGB1\naeJA8h7l5JQ6zimxmUxbC/Lj/vHLdJvjuYRdSjf2Yq3WPJjXeEsydRVXKNc7V1Mg\nWXae4pBKWUJ+tLM5cQyYRxsHolrVajt7i4lKyzX+ObXxEhLGznd+ijS+Vj4T7D/d\nRsEynLKi8fo4jHxiMep8wZMD/ifiLk6A1EIdRolWF94y6LJSLrWVjLdj4xFrsyF4\nmvt90NeMUsjrrU1xH2DVmnpgZpLJiwrBRfR+f7oxrvhpqDJueVLm3u7KrvIBWyzX\nozKr4lJGEM3ET6i0riDIXhBQiikSvPQGD4UaAPHitYwbuyTip24FzS6hkWPkj5IH\nLP/13/ITUBFajpKKW