VlZDZlOTkxMTIxZjNjMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/download-helper/commit/20b3ef1be2c864d9f319dbc73f2b76f926e2006c","sha":"20b3ef1be2c864d9f319dbc73f2b76f926e2006c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/commits/20b3ef1be2c864d9f319dbc73f2b76f926e2006c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/download-helper/commit/d18db62a513de6a92504ad9a08aca9a1e69c83bc","sha":"d18db62a513de6a92504ad9a08aca9a1e69c83bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/commits/d18db62a513de6a92504ad9a08aca9a1e69c83bc"}],"sha":"49fc2eebd1ddbf0e24b4b262eed6e991121f3c04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/commits/49fc2eebd1ddbf0e24b4b262eed6e991121f3c04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/commits/d18db62a513de6a92504ad9a08aca9a1e69c83bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:52:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:52:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: harden download filename handling against path traversal and blank input\n\nS1/R1: download() resolved targetFile via FilenameUtils.getName(filename) only.\ngetName returns \"..\" verbatim (no separator to strip) and null for null input, so\nnew File(folder, \"..\") could resolve to the parent of the download folder, and a\nnull/empty name could NPE or target the folder itself. Add DownloadPaths.resolveContainedFile\nwith a canonical-path containment check; reject empty/dot/dot-dot names. Fail fast with a\nDOWNLOAD_FAILED email instead of writing to an unsafe path.\n\nS2/R2: DownloadHelperMutationExtension.deleteFile() duplicated the canonical-path\ncontainment logic inline. Route it through the shared DownloadPaths helper so both the\ndownload and delete paths use one tested implementation (DRY; closes the same dot/dot-dot\nedge there too).\n\nS3/R3: triggerDownload() spawned an async thread before validating its @GraphQLNonNull\nprotocol/url/filename were non-blank. Reject blank input at the boundary (fail fast,\nreturn FALSE) before allocating a thread.\n\nTests: new DownloadPathsTest (JUnit 5 + AssertJ) covering plain names, directory\nstripping, null/empty/path-only/dot rejection, traversal collapse, and folder containment.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"56d186f28fff1474301a1c6a94ceeae991716f13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/trees/56d186f28fff1474301a1c6a94ceeae991716f13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/commits/d18db62a513de6a92504ad9a08aca9a1e69c83bc","verification":{"payload":"tree 56d186f28fff1474301a1c6a94ceeae991716f13\nparent 20b3ef1be2c864d9f319dbc73f2b76f926e2006c\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781070740 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781070740 +0200\n\nfix: harden download filename handling against path traversal and blank input\n\nS1/R1: download() resolved targetFile via FilenameUtils.getName(filename) only.\ngetName returns \"..\" verbatim (no separator to strip) and null for null input, so\nnew File(folder, \"..\") could resolve to the parent of the download folder, and a\nnull/empty name could NPE or target the folder itself. Add DownloadPaths.resolveContainedFile\nwith a canonical-path containment check; reject empty/dot/dot-dot names. Fail fast with a\nDOWNLOAD_FAILED email instead of writing to an unsafe path.\n\nS2/R2: DownloadHelperMutationExtension.deleteFile() duplicated the canonical-path\ncontainment logic inline. Route it through the shared DownloadPaths helper so both the\ndownload and delete paths use one tested implementation (DRY; closes the same dot/dot-dot\nedge there too).\n\nS3/R3: triggerDownload() spawned an async thread before validating its @GraphQLNonNull\nprotocol/url/filename were non-blank. Reject blank input at the boundary (fail fast,\nreturn FALSE) before allocating a thread.\n\nTests: new DownloadPathsTest (JUnit 5 + AssertJ) covering plain names, directory\nstripping, null/empty/path-only/dot rejection, traversal collapse, and folder containment.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoo+5QACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3ngUwgAxjQW3omOHftDlTql90AShhQlaw2c0ePcRCq9marFcfLfugBDIR7Z+Y25\ndMJHtCM3ixZWeXhX0tT67IrfOHYUDxj2lLAoQW7igcUNbJyIDUrJviUpKmNUv7bm\nhdNJM5S28z0DDnaGbtQ5t3hh7FZiqRvzjXgOLMCxDXLX314qHZFbkYGju/jLwLU1\ndPuToZ1nHh1p+djNkynVYt3S115Y3x8o8VIxNmP5ZEsOTcOi755TPDmNccCQ8xoA\nXBOXut+RdF4sKM4h+T0ScihYTzS9YWjklAPLlA3mGNCsCIVKXeFvlMHuEZvqQ5xT\nrSwJVNK3tK328QMyBZz3chawGf8imQ==\n=M0zR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T05:52:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","f