and DownloadHelperQueryExtension\nall lacked the Math.min(digitGroups, UNITS.length-1) guard that prevented\nan ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException for files/volumes larger than 1 PiB.\n\nFileSizeUtils.format() includes the guard; all three callers are updated to\ndelegate to it.  Removes the duplicated UNITS/KILO_CONSTANT/DecimalFormat\nconstants from GqlDownloadedFile and DownloadHelperQueryExtension.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3129b344d1385e475d6624ed1deb432859877c36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/trees/3129b344d1385e475d6624ed1deb432859877c36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/commits/6e16158037d2656aef5417d4c72bb7c240ae156f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3129b344d1385e475d6624ed1deb432859877c36\nparent def161110334fd1ecce7656234ae4c636102734d\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749997 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749997 +0200\n\nrefactor: extract FileSizeUtils and fix ArrayIndexOutOfBounds for >1 PiB\n\nIntroduce FileSizeUtils.format() as the single source of truth for the\nhuman-readable byte-count formatter.  The three previous inline copies in\nDownloadHelperService, GqlDownloadedFile and DownloadHelperQueryExtension\nall lacked the Math.min(digitGroups, UNITS.length-1) guard that prevented\nan ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException for files/volumes larger than 1 PiB.\n\nFileSizeUtils.format() includes the guard; all three callers are updated to\ndelegate to it.  Removes the duplicated UNITS/KILO_CONSTANT/DecimalFormat\nconstants from GqlDownloadedFile and DownloadHelperQueryExtension.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFq0ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3n5ywf/Z6vUF79HZO9+O9q+1/4Q/aLe6xPbmjhLB7ABIJAtMBwEzkJyPoMOzwHS\nn1DX+3ji023zwR1GybHvtLVbast+HqrzvlwflCfH0Fs2MZt8F3Js6ENyDxa4LoiC\nr699WJMvSljmlJEcc