e,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/commits/406ed1ce74b2ed4489063d8f5858abf17490a76e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T07:52:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T07:52:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"security: harden DownloadHelperService against SSRF, log injection, chunked-DoS and concurrency bugs\n\n- SSRF defense-in-depth: reject URLs that resolve to loopback, link-local,\n  site-local, any-local, multicast addresses, the AWS/Azure/OpenStack\n  metadata IP 169.254.169.254, or to well-known cloud metadata hostnames\n  (metadata.google.internal, metadata.goog, metadata). Validation is\n  applied to both HTTPS and FTP downloads.\n- URL-encode the FTP password (previously only the login was encoded);\n  passwords containing reserved characters could otherwise break URL\n  parsing or leak via stack traces.\n- Log injection: strip CR/LF from user-supplied url/filename/user values\n  before they are passed to the SLF4J logger.\n- Chunked-transfer DoS: when Content-Length is non-positive the download\n  is now capped at currently-available disk space and aborted otherwise,\n  preventing an admin-supplied URL from filling the partition.\n- Thread safety: SimpleDateFormat was shared across the raw download\n  threads. It is now instantiated per call via formatNow() to avoid\n  race conditions (and to avoid ThreadLocal classloader leaks in OSGi).\n- Guard sanitizeForLog() calls with isInfoEnabled/isErrorEnabled to\n  avoid eagerly building log arguments that may be discarded (S2629).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"903edef7fc53a3bc84ee3fc518a5adbf71b3502a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/trees/903edef7fc53a3bc84ee3fc518a5adbf71b3502a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/download-helper/git/commits/406ed1ce74b2ed4489063d8f5858abf17490a76e","verification":{"payload":"tree 903edef7fc53a3bc84ee3fc518a5adbf71b3502a\nparent b32f4884c2e1805a7d8f26af551d11d60775ecab\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778917948 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778917948 +0200\n\nsecurity: harden DownloadHelperService against SSRF, log injection, chunked-DoS and concurrency bugs\n\n- SSRF defense-in-depth: reject URLs that resolve to loopback, link-local,\n  site-local, any-local, multicast addresses, the AWS/Azure/OpenStack\n  metadata IP 169.254.169.254, or to well-known cloud metadata hostnames\n  (metadata.google.internal, metadata.goog, metadata). Validation is\n  applied to both HTTPS and FTP downloads.\n- URL-encode the FTP password (previously only the login was encoded);\n  passwords containing reserved characters could otherwise break URL\n  parsing or leak via stack traces.\n- Log injection: strip CR/LF from user-supplied url/filename/user values\n  before they are passed to the SLF4J logger.\n- Chunked-transfer DoS: when Content-Length is non-positive the download\n  is now capped at currently-available disk space and aborted otherwise,\n  preventing an admin-supplied URL from filling the partition.\n- Thread safety: SimpleDateFormat was shared across the raw download\n  threads. It is now instantiated per call via formatNow() to avoid\n  race conditions (and to avoid ThreadLocal classloader leaks in OSGi).\n- Guard sanitizeForLog() calls with isInfoEnabled/isErrorEnabled to\n  avoid eagerly building log arguments that may be discarded (S2629).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIIjwACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nxSAf/