"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/04302221c5f7fa61577eb8421c052e2f3023112b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:26:18Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:26:18Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v3.2.2\n\n* (@hdering) Fixed: after a browser tab with a live stream was closed, \"Cannot send to UI: ... is not registered\" was logged for every frame and the stream kept running (#201)\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: the live picture of a camera in ioBroker.devices froze after a minute - the widget did not renew its subscription","tree":{"sha":"a35fa93ae10608e4b739d828307ecc65edc91538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/a35fa93ae10608e4b739d828307ecc65edc91538"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/04302221c5f7fa61577eb8421c052e2f3023112b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/04302221c5f7fa61577eb8421c052e2f3023112b","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDA0MzAyMjIxYzVmN2ZhNjE1NzdlYjg0MjFjMDUyZTJmMzAyMzExMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e","sha":"5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e"}],"sha":"04302221c5f7fa61577eb8421c052e2f3023112b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/04302221c5f7fa61577eb8421c052e2f3023112b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:18:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:18:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Renew the camera subscription of the devices widget\n\nThe adapter answers every subscription with a heartbeat of 60 s, and a\nclient that does not re-subscribe within it is dropped by js-controller\nwith reason \"timeout\". RtspCameraComponent subscribed once in\nstartCamera() and otherwise only on a dialog toggle, so the live tile in\nioBroker.devices froze on its last frame after at most a minute - and\nsilently, because the send error happens on the adapter side and never\nreaches the browser. It did not recover either: startCamera() returns\nearly while subscribedTo is set.\n\nThe heartbeat is taken from the subscribe answer instead of hard-coding\nan interval, and renewed at half of it. The vis-2 widget does the same\nwith its 14 s refresh. Renewing is just another subscribe: the adapter\nrefreshes the timestamp of the existing subscription and restarts ffmpeg\nonly if the requested width really changed, which is also what the\ndialog toggle uses - that path is now the same call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9dde0f3c8e9b91ebc18928b8fbbd7a0fb84e287e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/9dde0f3c8e9b91ebc18928b8fbbd7a0fb84e287e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDU4OTFmZmMzZDViNDhlMDFlOTdlNDI4MTU4M2I0NjkwMmRkNzM0M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","sha":"544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626"}],"sha":"5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/5891ffc3d5b48e01e97e4281583b46902dd7343e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/69a176c6cf5bb374168e7dd00dcee0a67d26a7a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:13:59Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:13:59Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"message":"Show how to send the image of the image message to a messenger\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71114f4bd14d037ad78efd450a857041aa581965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/71114f4bd14d037ad78efd450a857041aa581965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/69a176c6cf5bb374168e7dd00dcee0a67d26a7a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/69a176c6cf5bb374168e7dd00dcee0a67d26a7a4","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDY5YTE3NmM2Y2Y1YmIzNzQxNjhlN2RkMDBkY2VlMGE2N2QyNmE3YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","sha":"544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626"}],"sha":"69a176c6cf5bb374168e7dd00dcee0a67d26a7a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/69a176c6cf5bb374168e7dd00dcee0a67d26a7a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:06:24Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:06:24Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Stop a stream whose last GUI client is gone\n\nRemoving the subscription of a client that is not registered anymore left\nnothing for the timeout unsubscribe to find, so ffmpeg kept running and\nevery frame went into the `.stream` state forever. onSendToUIError now\nstops the stream itself once no subscriber for that camera is left, the\nsame check onClientUnsubscribe does. Several frames of one client can be\nin flight, so a rejection for a subscription that is already gone does\nnothing - otherwise it would stop a stream that a new client restarted\nin the meantime.\n\nAn unsubscribe without a message additionally sweeps every camera with an\nobsolete subscription, not only those of the client that timed out: a\nclient that stops renewing without an unsubscribe of its own is never\nreported again, so nothing else would ever look at its subscriptions.\nCameras without any subscription stay untouched - such a stream was\nstarted by writing `<camera>.running` and does not belong to a GUI\nclient. Both paths share isObsolete() so they cannot drift apart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d6488535b1562b1ee123320d8376ba4d6539d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/4d6488535b1562b1ee123320d8376ba4d6539d1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDU0NGVkZmYxZjVkMmM3MzY2NDA4MTk4YzA5YWQ5MTZjYTQ2ZmI2MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95","sha":"9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95"}],"sha":"544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/544edff1f5d2c7366408198c09ad916ca46fb626"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:52:48Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:52:48Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"message":"Forget GUI clients whose subscription timed out\n\nWhen a browser tab with a live stream was closed without unsubscribing,\nthe controller reported the timeout with reason \"timeout\" and without a\nmessage. onClientUnsubscribe returned early in that case, so the\nsubscription stayed forever: ffmpeg kept running and every frame was sent\nto a client that was not registered anymore.\n\nThe frame handler was meant to forget such clients, but it collected them\nin the rejection handler of sendToUI, which runs after the loop that\nremoved them - so none was ever removed, and every frame logged\n\"Cannot send to UI: ... is not registered\".\n\n- A timeout drops all subscriptions of the client and stops the cameras\n  nobody watches anymore.\n- A client that is not registered is removed right in the rejection\n  handler and logged on debug level only.\n\nFixes #201\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c8ce82d1cecfbb35db90d97b6c4e615aaaccc84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/9c8ce82d1cecfbb35db90d97b6c4e615aaaccc84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDlkMTY4NTY5MjU2NjlhNDk2NTI3MmYxOWIxNTU1NWViMTFkZjdmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/f885725ecfaecaa3294eb9be20b05860075fcb45","sha":"f885725ecfaecaa3294eb9be20b05860075fcb45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/f885725ecfaecaa3294eb9be20b05860075fcb45"}],"sha":"9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/9d16856925669a4965272f19b15555eb11df7f95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gith