comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:24:08Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:24:08Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"message":"Show the camera web URL with https if the web instance uses it\n\nThe admin tab always put http:// in front of the web instance address, also\nwhen ioBroker.web runs with \"secure\". The link then led nowhere. The scheme\nnow follows native.secure of the configured web instance.\n\nThe URL of the adapter''s own server (bind:port?key=...) stays http, that\nserver never runs TLS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d2cbb6445907ee4297c4160cede32f6bb90f264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/3d2cbb6445907ee4297c4160cede32f6bb90f264"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/69198f570930f194bb2cbff3b99a214ee77c167f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/69198f570930f194bb2cbff3b99a214ee77c167f","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDY5MTk4ZjU3MDkzMGYxOTRiYjJjYmZmM2I5OWEyMTRlZTc3YzE2N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd","sha":"c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd"}],"sha":"69198f570930f194bb2cbff3b99a214ee77c167f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/69198f570930f194bb2cbff3b99a214ee77c167f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/b5686a4912d6df3c74f937f8178478dd361aefbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:19:35Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:19:35Z","email":"github@dering-online.de","name":"hdering"},"message":"Add UniFi Protect camera type (#133)\n\nProtect re-streams every camera from the console with a token instead of\ncredentials: rtsp://<console>:7447/<token> or rtsps://<console>:7441/<token>.\n\n- New camera type \"unifi\". With an optional API key of the Protect\n  integration API the stream token is read from Protect at every start and\n  snapshots are taken by Protect directly; the dialog can list the cameras.\n  Without a key the token (or the whole link) is entered by hand, and it\n  stays the fallback if the API cannot be reached.\n- RTSPS support in the shared RTSP code; for go2rtc an rtsps:// source is\n  passed as rtspx://, since the console''s certificate is self-signed.\n- Snapshots of this type are decoded from key frames only. With H.265\n  (common on Protect cameras) the first frame otherwise comes out grey.\n- Optional RTSP port for port forwardings; empty follows the RTSPS setting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"955412602f66393d180de5f9e6feda94530cb726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/955412602f66393d180de5f9e6feda94530cb726"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/b5686a4912d6df3c74f937f8178478dd361aefbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3204979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hdering","id":3204979,"login":"hdering","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDQ5Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hdering","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/b5686a4912d6df3c74f937f8178478dd361aefbe","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKGI1Njg2YTQ5MTJkNmRmM2M3NGY5MzdmODE3ODQ3OGRkMzYxYWVmYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd","sha":"c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd"}],"sha":"b5686a4912d6df3c74f937f8178478dd361aefbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/b5686a4912d6df3c74f937f8178478dd361aefbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/c75f0ea5ca60f0ae1b421394dd9f1d453b14c6dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:15:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:15:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v3.1.0\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: after a single failed request a camera stayed broken until the adapter was restarted\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: after a live stream had ended, every snapshot kept showing its last frame\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: an RTSP camera with \"original width/height\" never delivered a picture, because the scale filter was passed to ffmpeg without `-vf`\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: the first picture of a live stream appeared only after a delay of 10 seconds\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: closing the view of one camera also unsubscribed the other cameras of the same browser\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: a camera that failed to start could throw when a GUI client unsubscribed from it\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: two cameras with the same IP address overwrote each other''s snapshot\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: a password containing `!` appeared in the log in clear text\n* (@GermanBluefox) Pictures are cached per requested size, so the web adapter and a widget no longer evict each other\n* (@GermanBluefox) A browser that leaves the page no longer produces warnings in the log\n* (@GermanBluefox) The universal camera type has a port field now - the port from the model table is only a suggestion\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: the model table of the universal type offered the port of somebody''s port forwarding as the default for 226 URLs\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: `[WIDTH]`, `[HEIGHT]` and `[AUTH]` in the URL of a universal camera were never replaced, and a placeholder was only replaced once per URL\n* (@GermanBluefox) Added the VIVOTEK H9161\n* (@GermanBluefox) Updated packages","tree":{"sha":"0e98f09abd2068cef8d71b5906e0a84ac0c2556d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/0e98f09abd2068c