nts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/210ab135752cdcf3c85fe35f3999430198a732d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:10:04Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:10:04Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v3.0.2\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) The web extension can now request snapshots via messages instead of the private HTTP server, which is used automatically when the cameras adapter runs on a different host than the web instance\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed: a failed snapshot request answered with an empty `{}` instead of the error message","tree":{"sha":"e18bfb6336b8079881bfc5248a9b317241ec6a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/e18bfb6336b8079881bfc5248a9b317241ec6a6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/210ab135752cdcf3c85fe35f3999430198a732d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/210ab135752cdcf3c85fe35f3999430198a732d8","node_id":"C_kwDODqs91NoAKDIxMGFiMTM1NzUyY2RjZjNjODVmZTM1ZjM5OTk0MzAxOThhNzMyZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commit/3d40e2b7ae799f5da1b763e86f4b17d04e135dff","sha":"3d40e2b7ae799f5da1b763e86f4b17d04e135dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/3d40e2b7ae799f5da1b763e86f4b17d04e135dff"}],"sha":"210ab135752cdcf3c85fe35f3999430198a732d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/210ab135752cdcf3c85fe35f3999430198a732d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/commits/3d40e2b7ae799f5da1b763e86f4b17d04e135dff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:02:47Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:02:47Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Measure and fix the cost of delivering a snapshot\n\nTwo independent findings, both measured; the benchmarks are in benchmark/.\n\nSnapshot transport\n------------------\nThe web extension runs in the ioBroker.web process and so far always reached\nthe adapter through its private HTTP server on 127.0.0.1. That hardwires both\nto the same host: with web on another machine the cameras simply do not work.\n\nIt can now request the picture with sendTo instead, which needs no open port\nand crosses hosts. That is not made the default, because it is a lot more\nexpensive - measured end to end through ioBroker.web against a jsonl database,\nmedian per request:\n\n    picture   http      message\n    42 KB     2.7 ms    34.5 ms\n    406 KB    4.6 ms    47.3 ms\n    1.2 MB    9.5 ms    85.3 ms\n\nMost of it is a fixed ~30 ms for the database round trip, and the payload goes\nthrough the states database base64 encoded, a load every adapter shares. The\ntransport is therefore picked automatically: http when the adapter runs on the\nsame host, message otherwise. snapshotTransport forces either one.\n\nImage pipeline\n--------------\nresizeImage() and rotateImage() re-encoded every picture through sharp even\nwhen no size and no angle were requested - two full decode/encode cycles for\nnothing, more expensive than the entire delivery:\n\n    picture        before     now\n    640x640        26.3 ms    0.0 ms\n    1280x1280      68.4 ms    0.0 ms\n    1920x1920     123.3 ms    0.0 ms\n\nIt also silently threw away quality: the result was 12-36 % smaller than what\nthe camera delivered, at sharp''s default quality of 80. A picture is now passed\nthrough untouched when it already is JPEG, judged by its magic bytes rather\nthan the content type the camera claims. Everything else is still converted, so\nthe documented \"result is always jpg\" still holds - the benchmark asserts it.\n\nAlso fixed: a failed snapshot request answered with an empty \"{}\", because\nJSON.stringify of an Error drops the message. It now returns the message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21a1f7e3b20340289d00a98e2a30518e51b2cf0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/21a1f7e3b20340289d00a98e2a30518e51b2cf0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/3d40e2b7ae799f5da1b763e86f4b17d04e135dff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizatio