follows the node.js release, must\n  be bumped together with \"engines\")\n- #227 dependabot cooldown of 7 days for normal npm updates\n- #247 removed the deprecated common.materialize from io-package.json\n- #245 js-controller dependency >=3.1.4 -> >=6.0.11\n- #241/#234 node.js >=22, test matrix 22.x + 24.x (node 20 is EOL)\n- #226 nothing to do, src/ already uses the node: prefix everywhere and the\n  patched file is gone since the vite migration\n- #210 Steinel cameras, as a manufacturer of the universal type rather than\n  a dedicated camera type: the URL is a fixed RTSP path with the credentials\n  inline, which UniversalCamera already covers via [USERNAME]/[PASSWORD]\n\nAlso pointed the frontend dependabot block at src-admin, src-widgets and\nsrc-devices; it still referenced /src, which has had no package.json since\nthe vite migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d2b79bd314bdb1a290b919b06c2423133f35d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/trees/7d2b79bd314bdb1a290b919b06c2423133f35d8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.cameras/git/commits/73a331b1b411ea5182a6fdbdcc0cef6f1f130730","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url"