hangyuang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangyuang/ssr/commits/0d04d862b0ac9863fa72e8e286139ee4ab677a10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:27:48Z","email":"leonin0829@gmail.com","name":"yuuang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:27:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vite): preserve scoped CSS for Vue SFCs loaded with ?chunkName query close #363 (#364)\n\n* fix(vite): preserve scoped CSS for Vue SFCs loaded with ?chunkName query\n\nWhen a Vue route entry is lazy-loaded via `?chunkName=detail-id`,\n`@vitejs/plugin-vue` sets `cssScopeTo: [descriptor.filename, \"default\"]`\nwhere descriptor.filename is the bare path (no query). But rolldown-vite''s\n`isCssScopeToRendered` looks up `renderedModules[importerId]` using the\nbare path, while the module is registered with its full ID including\n`?chunkName=xxx`. This mismatch causes scoped CSS to be incorrectly\ntree-shaken away.\n\nAdd `fixVueScopedCssPlugin` (enforce: \"post\") that patches cssScopeTo[0]\nto include the ?chunkName query, so the renderedModules lookup succeeds.\n\nCloses #363\n\n* chore: add .agents/, .claude/, *.report.html to .gitignore","tree":{"sha":"ca8d80a81b8c816f73820361099a19abaf929539","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangyuang/ssr/git/trees/ca8d80a81b8c816f73820361099a19abaf929539"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangyuang/ssr/git/commits/0d04d862b0ac9863fa72e8e286139ee4ab677a10","verification":{"payload":"tree ca8d80a81b8c816f73820361099a19abaf929539\nparent 7b593cc712c7546a365201ec9a4ae3857797b357\nauthor yuuang <leonin0829@gmail.com> 1786940868 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786940868 +0800\n\nfix(vite): preserve scoped CSS for Vue SFCs loaded with ?chunkName query close #363 (#364)\n\n* fix(vite): preserve scoped CSS for Vue SFCs loaded with ?chunkName query\n\nWhen a Vue route entry is lazy-loaded via `?chunkName=detail-id`,\n`@vitejs/plugin-vue` sets `cssScopeTo: [descriptor.filename, \"default\"]`\nwhere descriptor.filename is the bare path (no query). But rolldown-vite''s\n`isCssScopeToRendered` looks up `renderedModules[importerId]` using the\nbare path, while the module is registered with its full ID including\n`?chunkName=xxx`. This mismatch causes scoped CSS to be incorrectly\ntree-shaken away.\n\nAdd `fixVueScopedCssPlugin` (enforce: \"post\") that patches cssScopeTo[0]\nto include the ?chunkName query, so the renderedModules lookup succeeds.\n\nCloses #363\n\n* chore: add .agents/, .claude/, *.report.html to .gitignore","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgo3ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+zwQAHHv/oL/9fXt3fdvVYSv3lnL\nKGmrssV4UBCPVkrKOotcVxDBG5gPTLGlUQH1dhel4GrEytrriQCsX0zFgsWPGmVy\n4i0wjblU9PCGtbuWiN13CdaozRlT3u9gvrEhB9SDGHej+tqXsIAjDhKRtIFuOfQ/\nLazFqkWaJD69OAM3jaTvca19s7d+mmeqON9r17GQvaHmFRMfUbwAagDOEwEa3jb1\nl3b2aJyeiiA+6OPBvSJ+NJEJYtTnKWEyGV06Q7At87Bta2INTOR3g/RSUC4NLg9G\nM6+Zq3HBTadiVcqWgHGq+0uccWrgQXJpyWkjOOdORs1alZ8lAX0rJWlkNvUyDV4j\nHZEfJgfGZ6uT+B/OTDbAzH/J4zTmxr+yZ6alfnEsZ2fjbr/CT6Eh9rnHw1YVwiRI\nJyGmgRKdgH9REBIkOgDUQpV/JCbWcJYmwMlS5qk7CiavdWBzki4PbyGW0CKvIpMt\nanWkh1DOq30Ky5JSt9iYcdUlMgbcHcfK4v+vCOz3cadRoCnsSTzQLq6Z62E7yJ0v\nCHqwHRIBdpZ+k2ct/KnhR7eSDiDMGeheGu9RIORAYj0RInI571Oy3GeGAHir8yE3\nk5E3paSiaZojovVjaGKb5FaD+DfRL83X9rlg7hM5ObnYTO5MxmBHPZMbZmywDIK/\ne6LzfW5YeJ7aZBejvygp\n=myFx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T04:27:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"http