l_url":"https://github.com/phamnamlong","id":5010238,"login":"phamnamlong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTAyMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/commits/cee5942dca6db3d1d56ad4265c7b6b5a8f89004d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T16:16:44Z","email":"long@abivin.com","name":"phamnamlong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T16:16:44Z","email":"long@abivin.com","name":"phamnamlong"},"message":"feat(vkernel): implement 6 System App pages (v1.8.0)\n\nSystem Utilities added to vKernel dashboard:\n- App Store (/dashboard/appstore) — SyR-PLAT-00.01\n  Browse, install, uninstall vApps. 4 industry bundles.\n  Dependency resolution modal. Tab UI: EXPLORE/INSTALLED/UPDATES.\n\n- Settings / IAM (/dashboard/settings) — SyR-PLAT-00.02\n  CRUDIEA permission matrix (C/R/U/D/L/I/E/A × 6 roles).\n  Live permissions from PermissionEntity. General config cards.\n\n- vAudit (/dashboard/audit) — SyR-PLAT-00.04\n  Immutable event audit log with filter/search.\n  Expandable detail rows with JSONB payload viewer.\n  Stats: total/published/failed/source apps.\n\n- vData / MDM (/dashboard/data) — SyR-PLAT-00.03\n  Golden Records browser: stakeholders, currencies, countries.\n  JSONB extension viewer with example documentation.\n\n- vFlow / Automation (/dashboard/automation) — SyR-PLAT-00.03\n  Event subscription wiring canvas (trigger→filter→action).\n  Subscriptions table + run history tab.\n\n- vMonitor / Health (/dashboard/monitor) — SyR-PLAT-00.04\n  Live health dashboard (actuator/health, actuator/metrics).\n  JVM memory bars, thread count, GC pauses.\n  Prometheus raw metrics viewer. Auto-refresh 30s.\n\nBackend:\n- DashboardController: 6 new @GetMapping routes\n- AdaptiveShellController: System Utilities (6) sidebar section\n- vkernel.css: stat-label, stat-value, card.stat, card.full classes\n- 7 existing template navs updated with System App links\n- 6 new MockMvc tests in PlatformApiTests (Order 60-65)\n- All 41 tests PASS (BUILD SUCCESS)","tree":{"sha":"ca9533a38794dafb2f68e746fdb55b548b9fe424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/git/trees/ca9533a38794dafb2f68e746fdb55b548b9fe424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/git/commits/cee5942dca6db3d1d56ad4265c7b6b5a8f89004d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5010238?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamnamlong","id":5010238,"login":"phamnamlong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTAyMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/commit/cee5942dca6db3d1d56ad4265c7b6b5a8f89004d","node_id":"C_kwDODzvt3toAKGNlZTU5NDJkY2E2ZG