hamnamlong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/commits/e95c75d21bf0c156f575cdc7a7c2846e9ddf0103/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T15:03:18Z","email":"long@abivin.com","name":"phamnamlong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T15:03:18Z","email":"long@abivin.com","name":"phamnamlong"},"message":"feat: Implement shared UI shell + fix vMarketing-Org stability\n\nCore Changes:\n\n## Adaptive Shell & Unified Topbar Architecture\n\n- **Created /ui/app-layout.css** (141 lines)\n  - Shared topbar stylesheet with Abivin branding (52px sticky header)\n  - Gradient ''Ab'' logo pill, search box (Ctrl+K), notifications bell, settings link\n  - Dark theme (--vr-* CSS vars), responsive mobile hiding\n  - Served by vKernel at /static/ui/app-layout.css\n\n- **Created /ui/app-layout.js** (v2 with iframe detection)\n  - Hydrates #vr-topbar[data-app-title=...] div with interactive topbar HTML\n  - **Iframe Detection:** Suppresses duplicate topbar when window.self !== window.top\n  - Prevents duplicate rendering in micro-frontend shell context\n  - Search, settings, notifications handlers included\n\n- **Updated All 4 vApps**\n  - vstrategy, vfinacc, vdesign-physical, vmarketing-org\n  - Each now references shared /ui/ CSS + JS instead of local .header\n  - Removed 5-10 lines of redundant CSS per app\n  - Added data-app-title attribute for contextual topbar labeling\n\n- **Updated AdaptiveShellController.java**\n  - Replaced old sidebar header (⚙ vRoute OS) with Abivin branding\n  - Added gradient pill logo (.logo-mark) + name/sub labels\n  - Added notifications bell button (#notif-btn) with red dot indicator\n  - Added settings gear link (href=/dashboard)\n  - Updated copyright: 2025 → 2026\n\n- **Updated SecurityConfig.java**\n  - Added .requestMatchers(\"/ui/**\").permitAll()\n  - Allows all vApps to fetch shared CSS/JS without Bearer token\n\n## vMarketing-Org Critical Fixes\n\n- **Fixed Table Name Mismatch (models.py)**\n  - Root cause: ORM declared vmkt_* table names (vmkt_campaigns, vmkt_tracking_events, etc.)\n  - Reality: Alembic migration created tables WITHOUT vmkt_ prefix (campaigns, tracking_events, etc.)\n  - Impact: All 5 APIs returned HTTP 500 (SQLAlchemy relation not found errors)\n  - Fixed: All 5 tablenames corrected to match DB schema\n\n- **Fixed App Entry Point (main.py)**\n  - Added GET / route to handle Spring gateway path stripping\n  - Changed static mount from /static to / with html=True\n  - Now matches vstrategy pattern for proper gateway integration\n\n- **Rebuilt Dashboard (static/index.html)**\n  - Replaced: 5 static feature description cards\n  - Created: Live 270-line data-fetching dashboard with 5 sections\n  - Sections: [SyR-MKT-00] Campaigns, [SyR-MKT-02] Segments, [SyR-MKT-03] Assets, [SyR-MKT-04] Leads, [SyR-MKT-01] Events\n  - Features: Real API integration, metric counters, status pills, colour-coded indicators\n  - Theme: Dark GitHub style (#0d1117 bg, #161b22 cards)\n  - 5 async fetch() calls + 5 render functions with formatted numbers/dates\n\n## Verification\n\n✓ All 5 vmarketing APIs return HTTP 200 + seed data\n✓ Dashboard displays live campaign/segment/asset tables\n✓ Shared topbar visible in shell; hidden via iframe detection in direct app access\n✓ All containers running: vKernel:8080, vstrategy:8081, vfinacc:8082, vdesign:8083, vmarketing:8084\n\n## Files Modified\n\n- 01-vkernel/src/main/resources/static/ui/app-layout.css (+NEW)\n- 01-vkernel/src/main/resources/static/ui/app-layout.js (+NEW)\n- 01-vkernel/src/main/java/com/abivin/vkernel/AdaptiveShellController.java (+branding)\n- 01-vkernel/src/main/java/com/abivin/vkernel/g1_iam/SecurityConfig.java (+/ui/** permit-all)\n- 02-vstrategy/static/index.html (+shared topbar)\n- 03-vfinacc/static/index.html (+shared topbar)\n- 04-vdesign-physical/static/index.html (+shared topbar)\n- 05-vmarketing-org/app/main.py (+GET / route, fixed static mount)\n- 05-vmarketing-org/app/models.py (+fixed 5 tablenames)\n- 05-vmarketing-org/static/index.html (+complete dashboard rewrite)\n- 05-vmarketing-org/README.md (+dashboard section, recent changes notes)\n- CHANGELOG.md (+v1.7.1 entry)\n\n## Backwards Compatibility\n\n- Standalone app URLs (/vstrategy/, /vfinacc/, etc.) still show app-specific topbar\n- Iframe context automatically hides app topbar (prevents duplication)\n- No breaking API changes\n- All existing routes continue to work\\n","tree":{"sha":"9b5ffbad185a5bd467453a77b9d2710d9970516c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/git/trees/9b5ffbad185a5bd467453a77b9d2710d9970516c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abivin-IT/vRoute-Open/git/commits/e95c75d21bf0c156f575cdc7a7c2846e9ddf0103","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5010238?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamnamlong","id":5010238,"login":"phamnamlong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTAyMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamnamlong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti