/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-assets/commits/7757cc9083dcdc309dfdbed989f959652900e41a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T11:13:37Z","email":"gduval@redhat.com","name":"Guillaume Duval"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T11:13:37Z","email":"gduval@redhat.com","name":"Guillaume Duval"},"message":"[RHCLOUD-51284] Add severity half-circle images for Outlook emails\n\nOutlook''s Word rendering engine does not support CSS border-radius,\nso rounded pill-shaped severity badges render as plain rectangles.\nThese half-circle PNG images (left and right caps for each severity\ncolor) are placed on either side of the badge content in MSO\nconditional blocks, simulating rounded corners the same way\ncircle_64_left/right.png already does for CTA buttons.\n\nColors match the existing severity palette:\n- Low (#707070), Moderate (#DCA614), Important (#CA6C0F), Critical (#B1380B)\n\nImages are 10x20 px with alpha transparency, metadata stripped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5939a5d0eb1877a385b98a94db7db240859dd845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-assets/git/trees/5939a5d0eb1877a385b98a94db7db240859dd845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-assets/git/commits/7757cc9083dcdc309dfdbed989f959652900e41a","verification":{"payload":"tree 5939a5d0eb1877a385b98a94db7db240859dd845\nparent 247fd7be8a3dba36f257d49b2f30ac376f9886e9\nauthor Guillaume Duval <gduval@redhat.com> 1789470817 +0200\ncommitter Guillaume Duval <gduval@redhat.com> 1789470817 +0200\n\n[RHCLOUD-51284] Add severity half-circle images for Outlook emails\n\nOutlook''s Word rendering engine does not support CSS border-radius,\nso rounded pill-shaped severity badges render as plain rectangles.\nThese half-circle PNG images (left and right caps for each severity\ncolor) are placed on either side of the badge content in MSO\nconditional blocks, simulating rounded corners the same way\ncircle_64_left/rig